# Route: guide 36 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 33 quests, 1.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Ironforge, Wetlands): Craftsmen's Terrace -> near
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge
# -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Menethil Harbor -> Black Channel Marsh ->
# ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199),
# Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Mythology of the
# Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost Tablets of Will
# (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace (2204), The Lost
# Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential Artificials (2924),
# The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929), Data Rescue (2930),
